<br>
## Expected Outcomes<br>
A comprehensive understanding of the current state of sustainable fashion practices and technologies.<br>
A clear strategy for incorporating recycled materials into fashion designs.<br>
Recommendations for new technologies that can help minimize the carbon footprint of fashion production.<br>
